{"path":"contact.html","content":"<!doctype html>
<html lang='en'>
<head>
  <meta charset='utf-8'>
  <meta name='viewport' content='width=device-width,initial-scale=1'>
  <title>Contact — {{BUSINESS_NAME}}</title>
  <meta name='description' content='Reach out to schedule a session, plan an experience, or ask questions about gatherings and private work.'>
  <style>
    :root{
      --bg:#0f1513; --card:#0f1716; --muted:#95a89a; --accent:#b9f0df; --glass:rgba(255,255,255,0.04); --maxw:950px;
      --round:12px; --mono:ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, Monaco, 'Roboto Mono', monospace;
    }
    *{box-sizing:border-box}
    html,body{height:100%}
    body{
      margin:0; font-family: Inter, system-ui, -apple-system, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial; color: #e9f6f0; background: radial-gradient(1200px 600px at 10% 10%, rgba(185,240,223,0.04), transparent), linear-gradient(180deg,#071211 0%, #071917 100%);
      -webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased; -moz-osx-font-smoothing:grayscale; padding:32px;
    }
    header{max-width:var(--maxw); margin:0 auto 28px; display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:space-between}
    .brand{display:flex; gap:14px; align-items:center}
    .logo{width:56px;height:56px;border-radius:14px;background:linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(185,240,223,0.08), rgba(255,255,255,0.02));display:grid;place-items:center; font-weight:700; color:var(--accent); font-family:var(--mono)}
    nav a{color:var(--muted); text-decoration:none; margin-left:18px; font-size:14px}
    main{max-width:var(--maxw); margin:0 auto; display:grid; grid-template-columns:1fr 420px; gap:28px}
    @media (max-width:980px){main{grid-template-columns:1fr; padding:0 8px}}
    .hero{background:linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(255,255,255,0.02), transparent); padding:28px; border-radius:var(--round); box-shadow:0 6px 24px rgba(0,0,0,0.6)}
    .hero h1{margin:0 0 6px; font-weight:600; letter-spacing:-0.02em}
    .hero p{margin:0 0 14px; color:var(--muted)}
    .card{background:var(--card); padding:18px; border-radius:12px; box-shadow:0 6px 28px rgba(0,0,0,0.55)}
    label{display:block; font-size:13px; color:var(--muted); margin-bottom:8px}
    input[type='text'], input[type='email'], select, textarea, input[type='number']{width:100%; padding:10px 12px; border-radius:10px; border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.04); background:var(--glass); color:inherit; outline:none}
    .muted{color:var(--muted); font-size:13px}
    .flex{display:flex; gap:12px}
    .btn{background:linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(185,240,223,0.14), rgba(185,240,223,0.06)); color:var(--accent); padding:10px 14px; border-radius:10px; border:0; cursor:pointer}
    .ghost{background:transparent; border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.04)}
    .widget{display:grid; gap:12px}
    .small{font-size:13px}
    .events-list{display:grid; gap:12px}
    .event-row{display:flex; justify-content:space-between; align-items:center; gap:12px; padding:10px; border-radius:10px; background:linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(255,255,255,0.01), transparent)}
    .pill{background:rgba(255,255,255,0.02); padding:6px 10px; border-radius:999px; font-size:13px}
    footer{max-width:var(--maxw); margin:28px auto 0; color:var(--muted); font-size:13px}
    .disclaimer{font-size:13px; color:#e6cfcf; background:linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(255,100,80,0.03), transparent); padding:12px; border-radius:10px}
    .copy-area{background:#071716;padding:12px;border-radius:8px;font-family:var(--mono);font-size:13px;color:var(--accent);white-space:pre-wrap}
    .linkish{color:var(--accent); text-decoration:none}
    .packing-list{display:grid; gap:8px}
    .count-badge{font-weight:600; color:var(--accent)}
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <header>
    <div class='brand'>
      <div class='logo'>SB</div>
      <div>
        <div style='font-weight:700'>{{BUSINESS_NAME}}</div>
        <div class='muted' style='margin-top:4px'>Contact & planning</div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <nav aria-label='Main navigation'>
      <a href='index.html'>Journey</a>
      <a href='events.html'>Gatherings</a>
      <a href='private-sessions.html'>Private</a>
      <a href='pricing.html'>Investment</a>
      <a href='about.html'>Stories</a>
      <a href='faq.html'>FAQs</a>
      <a href='book.html'>Book</a>
      <a href='contact.html' style='color:var(--accent)'>Contact</a>
    </nav>
  </header>

  <main>
    <section>
      <div class='hero card'>
        <h1>Let's plan something resonant</h1>
        <p>Use the Session Planner to craft a focused practice, or pick a gathering and get a tailored packing list. We keep the tools lightweight — you keep the results.</p>
        <div style='display:flex; gap:10px; margin-top:12px'>
          <a class='btn' href='book.html'>{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</a>
          <a class='btn ghost' href='faq.html'>Questions?</a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div style='margin-top:18px' class='card'>
        <h3 style='margin:0 0 8px'>Session Planner</h3>
        <div class='widget'>
          <div>
            <label class='small'>Your name (optional)</label>
            <input type='text' id='planner-name' placeholder='E.g., Rowan'>
          </div>
          <div>
            <label class='small'>Primary intention</label>
            <select id='planner-intent'>
              <option value='Relaxation'>Relaxation</option>
              <option value='Focus'>Clarity & Focus</option>
              <option value='Sleep'>Evening wind-down</option>
              <option value='Release'>Emotional release</option>
              <option value='Custom'>Custom</option>
            </select>
          </div>
          <div class='flex'>
            <div style='flex:1'>
              <label class='small'>Duration (minutes)</label>
              <input type='number' id='planner-duration' min='10' max='120' value='30'>
            </div>
            <div style='width:150px'>
              <label class='small'>Frequency / week</label>
              <input type='number' id='planner-frequency' min='1' max='7' value='2'>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div>
            <label class='small'>Sounds you'd like</label>
            <div style='display:flex; gap:8px; flex-wrap:wrap'>
              <button type='button' class='btn ghost sound-toggle' data-sound='Gongs'>Gongs</button>
              <button type='button' class='btn ghost sound-toggle' data-sound='Singing Bowls'>Singing Bowls</button>
              <button type='button' class='btn ghost sound-toggle' data-sound='Chimes'>Chimes</button>
              <button type='button' class='btn ghost sound-toggle' data-sound='Voice'>Voice</button>
              <button type='button' class='btn ghost sound-toggle' data-sound='Silence'>Silence'>Silence</button>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div>
            <label class='small'>Notes / accessibility needs</label>
            <textarea id='planner-notes' rows='3' placeholder='Any sensitivities, hearing preferences, physical needs...'></textarea>
          </div>

          <div style='display:flex; gap:8px; align-items:center'>
            <button id='planner-build' class='btn'>Create plan</button>
            <button id='planner-clear' class='btn ghost'>Reset</button>
          </div>

          <div id='planner-output' style='display:none'>
            <h4 style='margin:8px 0 6px'>Your session plan</h4>
            <div id='planner-text' class='copy-area' aria-live='polite'></div>
            <div style='display:flex; gap:8px; margin-top:8px'>
              <button id='planner-copy' class='btn'>Copy text</button>
              <button id='planner-download' class='btn ghost'>Download .txt</button>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div style='margin-top:18px' class='card'>
        <h3 style='margin:0 0 8px'>Contact form</h3>
        <form id='contact-form'>
          <div style='display:grid; gap:8px'>
            <label class='small'>Name</label>
            <input type='text' id='cf-name' placeholder='Your full name'>
            <label class='small'>Email</label>
            <input type='email' id='cf-email' placeholder='{{EMAIL}}'>
            <label class='small'>Phone (optional)</label>
            <input type='text' id='cf-phone' placeholder='{{PHONE}}'>
            <label class='small'>Message</label>
            <textarea id='cf-message' rows='4' placeholder='Tell us about what you want to create'></textarea>
            <div style='display:flex; gap:8px'>
              <button type='submit' class='btn'>Send</button>
              <button type='reset' class='btn ghost'>Reset</button>
            </div>
            <div id='cf-status' class='muted' aria-live='polite'></div>
          </div>
        </form>
      </div>
    </section>

    <aside>
      <div class='card'>
        <h4 style='margin:0 0 8px'>Upcoming gatherings</h4>
        <p class='muted' style='margin-top:0'>Select seats to reserve locally (demo), then review a custom packing list.</p>

        <div id='events' class='events-list' style='margin-top:8px'></div>

        <div style='margin-top:12px'>
          <label class='small'>Selected seats</label>
          <div class='pill' id='selection-summary'>0 seats</div>
        </div>

        <div style='margin-top:12px' class='card'>
          <h5 style='margin:0 0 8px'>Packing list</h5>
          <div id='packing' class='packing-list muted'>No event selected.</div>
          <div style='display:flex; gap:8px; margin-top:8px'>
            <button id='packing-copy' class='btn ghost'>Copy list</button>
            <button id='packing-reset' class='btn'>Clear</button>
          </div>
        </div>

      </div>

      <div style='margin-top:14px' class='card'>
        <h5 style='margin:0 0 8px'>Quick contact</h5>
        <div class='muted'>Phone: <a class='linkish' href='tel:{{PHONE}}'>{{PHONE}}</a></div>
        <div class='muted'>Email: <a class='linkish' href='mailto:{{EMAIL}}'>{{EMAIL}}</a></div>
        <div class='muted' style='margin-top:8px'>Location: {{CITY}}, {{STATE}}</div>
      </div>

      <div style='margin-top:14px' class='card disclaimer'>
        <strong>Contraindications & notes</strong>
        <p style='margin:8px 0 0' class='small'>Sound sessions may not be appropriate if you have uncontrolled epilepsy, recent concussion, certain implanted devices, or active psychiatric crises. If you have a medical condition, pregnancy, or concerns, consult your healthcare provider before attending. Reach out and we will advise adaptations or alternative formats.</p>
      </div>
    </aside>
  </main>

  <footer>
    <div style='max-width:var(--maxw); margin:0 auto; display:flex; justify-content:space-between; align-items:center'>
      <div class='muted'>&copy; <span id='year'></span> {{BUSINESS_NAME}} — A practical, subtle craft for rest and clarity.</div>
      <div class='muted'>Built for gentle planning • Seed: 2775808003 • Slug: sound_bath-MORE-2026-02-17T10-06-28-222Z-012</div>
    </div>
  </footer>

  <script>
    // small helper
    function el(q){return document.querySelector(q)}
    function elAll(q){return Array.from(document.querySelectorAll(q))}

    // Year
    document.getElementById('year').textContent = new Date().getFullYear();

    // Session Planner
    const sounds = new Set();
    elAll('.sound-toggle').forEach(b=>{
      b.addEventListener('click', ()=>{
        const s = b.dataset.sound;
        if(sounds.has(s)){ sounds.delete(s); b.classList.remove('active'); b.classList.add('ghost'); } else { sounds.add(s); b.classList.remove('ghost'); }
      });
    });

    function buildPlan(){
      const name = el('#planner-name').value.trim();
      const intent = el('#planner-intent').value;
      const dur = parseInt(el('#planner-duration').value,10) || 30;
      const freq = parseInt(el('#planner-frequency').value,10) || 1;
      const notes = el('#planner-notes').value.trim();
      const chosen = Array.from(sounds);

      const header = name ? `Session plan for ${name}` : 'Personal session plan';
      let text = `${header}\n`;
      text += `Intention: ${intent} \nDuration: ${dur} minutes • ${freq}x per week\n`;
      text += `Preferred sounds: ${chosen.length?chosen.join(', '):'Mixed / guided silence'}\n\n`;
      text += 'Suggested structure:\n';

      // structure algorithm
      const warm = Math.max(3, Math.round(dur * 0.12));
      const main = Math.max(10, Math.round(dur * 0.72));
      const close = dur - warm - main;

      text += `- Arrival & centering (${warm} min): breathwork and posture checks.\n`;
      text += `- Immersion (${main} min): gentle sound field focused on ${intent.toLowerCase()}.\n`;
      text += `- Integration (${close} min): silence, simple reflection, slow return.\n\n`;

      if(notes){ text += `Notes: ${notes}\n\n`; }

      text += 'Recommendations:\n';
      if(chosen.includes('Gongs')) text += '- Place a soft cushion for spatial listening; be ready for low-frequency presence.\n';
      if(chosen.includes('Singing Bowls')) text += '- Comfortable reclining surface and eye-cover encouraged.\n';
      if(chosen.includes('Chimes')) text += '- Keep a light blanket handy; chimes favor lighter attention.\n';
      if(chosen.includes('Voice')) text += '- Expect guided phrases and invitations; allow for vocal rest after.\n';
      if(!chosen.length) text += '- Aim for a single anchor (breath or a soft tone).\n';

      text += `\nPractical: bring water, light layers, and anything that helps you rest.\n`;
      text += `If you have any implants, pacemakers, or are pregnant, consult the contraindications noted on the site.\n`;

      return text;
    }

    el('#planner-build').addEventListener('click', ()=>{
      const out = buildPlan();
      el('#planner-text').textContent = out;
      el('#planner-output').style.display = 'block';
    });

    el('#planner-clear').addEventListener('click', ()=>{
      el('#planner-name').value=''; el('#planner-duration').value='30'; el('#planner-frequency').value='2'; el('#planner-notes').value=''; sounds.clear(); elAll('.sound-toggle').forEach(b=>{b.classList.add('ghost')}); el('#planner-output').style.display='none';
    });

    el('#planner-copy').addEventListener('click', async ()=>{
      const text = el('#planner-text').textContent;
      try{ await navigator.clipboard.writeText(text); el('#planner-copy').textContent='Copied'; setTimeout(()=>el('#planner-copy').textContent='Copy text',1200);}catch(e){ alert('Copy failed — select and copy manually.'); }
    });

    el('#planner-download').addEventListener('click', ()=>{
      const text = el('#planner-text').textContent;
      const blob = new Blob([text],{type:'text/plain'});
      const url = URL.createObjectURL(blob);
      const a = document.createElement('a'); a.href=url; a.download='session-plan.txt'; document.body.appendChild(a); a.click(); a.remove(); URL.revokeObjectURL(url);
    });

    // Events + seat selector + packing list
    const EVENTS = [
      {id:1,title:'Resonant Wave',date:'2026-03-02',time:'18:30',capacity:18,style:'gongs'},
      {id:2,title:'Quiet Chime Evening',date:'2026-03-10',time:'19:00',capacity:12,style:'chimes'},
      {id:3,title:'Bowl & Breath: Short Intensive',date:'2026-03-17',time:'10:00',capacity:10,style:'bowls'}
    ];

    const state = { selections: {} };

    function renderEvents(){
      const container = el('#events'); container.innerHTML='';
      EVENTS.forEach(ev=>{
        const taken = state.selections[ev.id] || 0;
        const avail = Math.max(0, ev.capacity - (ev._reserved||0) - taken);
        const row = document.createElement('div'); row.className='event-row';
        row.innerHTML = `
          <div style='min-width:0'>
            <div style='font-weight:600'>${ev.title}</div>
            <div class='muted small'>${ev.date} • ${ev.time}</div>
          </div>
          <div style='display:flex; align-items:center; gap:8px'>
            <div class='muted small'>Seats</div>
            <input type='number' min='0' max='${avail}' value='${taken}' data-eid='${ev.id}' style='width:68px; padding:8px; border-radius:8px; background:transparent; border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.04)'>
            <div class='pill'>${avail} left</div>
          </div>
        `;
        container.appendChild(row);
      });

      // attach
      elAll('#events input[type=number]').forEach(i=>{
        i.addEventListener('input', ()=>{
          const id = parseInt(i.dataset.eid,10); const val = Math.max(0, Math.floor(Number(i.value)||0));
          const ev = EVENTS.find(e=>e.id===id);
          const max = Math.max(0, ev.capacity - (ev._reserved||0));
          if(val > max){ i.value = max; state.selections[id]=max; } else { state.selections[id]=val; }
          updateSelectionSummary();
          renderPacking();
          renderEvents();
        });
      });
    }

    function updateSelectionSummary(){
      const total = Object.values(state.selections).reduce((s,n)=>s+(Number(n)||0),0);
      el('#selection-summary').textContent = `${total} seat${total===1?'':'s'}`;
    }

    function renderPacking(){
      const selectedIds = Object.keys(state.selections).filter(k=>state.selections[k]>0).map(Number);
      if(selectedIds.length===0){ el('#packing').textContent='No event selected.'; return; }
      const lines = [];
      selectedIds.forEach(id=>{
        const ev = EVENTS.find(e=>e.id===id);
        const count = state.selections[id] || 0;
        lines.push(`${ev.title} (${ev.date} ${ev.time}) — ${count} seat${count===1?'':'s'}`);
        // base items
        lines.push('- Comfortable mat or cushion');
        lines.push('- Light blanket or shawl');
        lines.push('- Water bottle');
        // style adjustments
        if(ev.style==='gongs'){ lines.push('- Ear-aware earplugs (if sensitive to low frequencies)'); lines.push('- Soft pillow for head support'); }
        if(ev.style==='chimes'){ lines.push('- Eye-cover to soften attention'); }
        if(ev.style==='bowls'){ lines.push('- Thin neck pillow for extra support'); }
        lines.push('');
      });
      el('#packing').innerHTML = lines.map(l=>`<div>${l}</div>`).join('');
    }

    el('#packing-copy').addEventListener('click', async ()=>{
      const text = Array.from(el('#packing').querySelectorAll('div')).map(d=>d.textContent).join('\n');
      try{ await navigator.clipboard.writeText(text); el('#packing-copy').textContent='Copied'; setTimeout(()=>el('#packing-copy').textContent='Copy list',1200);}catch(e){ alert('Copy failed — select and copy manually.'); }
    });
    el('#packing-reset').addEventListener('click', ()=>{ state.selections = {}; updateSelectionSummary(); renderEvents(); renderPacking(); });

    // Seed some reserved numbers to illustrate availability
    EVENTS[0]._reserved = 4; EVENTS[1]._reserved = 2; EVENTS[2]._reserved = 0;
    renderEvents(); updateSelectionSummary(); renderPacking();

    // Contact form (demo local only)
    el('#contact-form').addEventListener('submit', (ev)=>{
      ev.preventDefault();
      const name = el('#cf-name').value; const email = el('#cf-email').value; const phone = el('#cf-phone').value; const message = el('#cf-message').value;
      el('#cf-status').textContent = 'Sending... (demo)';
      setTimeout(()=>{ el('#cf-status').textContent = 'Message noted — we will reply at ' + (email||'your email'); el('#contact-form').reset(); }, 800);
    });

  </script>
</body>
</html>"} 
{"path":"README.md","content":"# Contact page & planning tools (chunk 4)

This chunk provides the contact page and a README for the sound bath site scaffold.

Files included
- contact.html — Contact landing page with two interactive local tools:
  - Session Planner: build a short personalized plan (structure, suggestions) and export it as plaintext or download a .txt file. Uses only local JS; no network calls.
  - Events seat selector + packing list generator: choose seats (demo/local), see live availability, and generate a tailored packing checklist. Copy-to-clipboard supported.

Placeholders used
- {{BUSINESS_NAME}}, {{TAGLINE}}, {{PHONE}}, {{EMAIL}}, {{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}, {{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}, {{CITY}}, {{STATE}}

Design notes
- Layout: zen_minimal. Clean, muted palette with modern type and mono accents for the planners.
- Voice: mystic_modern — language leans atmospheric yet practical.
- Unique navigation labels: Journey, Gatherings, Private, Investment, Stories, FAQs, Book, Contact.
- Contraindications: a clear, responsible disclaimer is included in the sidebar.
- Seed/slug metadata: Seed 2775808003 and slug sound_bath-MORE-2026-02-17T10-06-28-222Z-012 are present in the footer for traceability.

Testing
1. Open contact.html in a browser.
2. Session Planner: choose intention, duration, sounds; click "Create plan." Use "Copy text" or "Download .txt" to export.
3. Events: change seat counts next to an event to simulate reservation; the packing list updates. Use "Copy list" to copy checklist text.
4. Contact form: sends a demo/local confirmation message (no network request).

Notes for integration
- The page references an SVG pattern at assets/img/pattern.svg for background accents. That asset should be supplied in another chunk to complete the visual system.
- Other pages (index.html, events.html, etc.) are not included in this chunk and will be provided separately.

Constraints followed
- No external fonts or CDNs. No external network requests. No images embedded.
- The two files here are standalone and safe to open locally.

Fields changed vs prior templates
- Different headline metaphors and CTAs are used. Program naming and navigation label set are intentionally distinct.

If you need adjustments to copy tone, structure of the planner output, or the packing-list rules, tell me which parts to tune."}
BUNDLE_END
